      "content": "thanks for saying that. i was really worried it was a stroke but hearing that it can be part of a migraine aura makes me feel a lot better. i'm feeling pretty nauseous too. if it is just a migraine, is there a specific dose of ibuprofen i should take to make sure it hits the headache hard enough? or should i try something else instead?",
